    "id": "S2.E11.m1",
    "alttext": "\\Var_{\\pi_{\\eta}^{X\\mid Y=y}}(f)\\leq\\frac{\\eta}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,\\mathbb{E}_{\\pi_{\\eta}^{X\\mid Y=y}}\\|\\nabla f\\|^{2}\\,,"
  },
  {
    "id": "S2.E12.m1",
